{"turn_id": "d03-t1", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_size", "text": "FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条来自 5.4M 篇维基百科文章语料的声明。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_scale", "text": "FEVER is described as the largest dataset, containing around 185k claims drawn from a corpus of 5.4M Wikipedia articles.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "FEVER claims are labeled as “SUPPORTS”, “REFUTES”, or “NOT ENOUGH INFO” based on the evidence set.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d03-t3", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_dataset_size", "text": "《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》指出，FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claim，来源于 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "clinical_no_fever", "text": "《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》未提及 FEVER 数据集；该论文研究的是来自 Mayo Clinic 的临床笔记与病理报告。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}]}, {"key": "unsupervised_qa_label_acc", "text": "《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》报告的标签准确率为 80.2%（开发集）和 80.25%（测试集），并称在“SUPPORTS”标签上达到 80.2% 的标签准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "unsupervised_qa_no_baseline_gap", "text": "所提供的《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》证据只给出绝对标签准确率，未说明相对基线的性能提升幅度数值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "clinical_outperforms_baselines_qualitative", "text": "《Clinical Information Extraction via Convolutional Neural Network》称其方法在标准评估数据集上持续优于现有基线，并显著优于基线，但未给出具体提升数值。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-712a82e231bc15b7c11610b4"}]}, {"key": "not_comparable", "text": "两篇论文涉及不同任务与数据集（事实核查的 FEVER 与临床信息抽取的临床笔记/病理报告），且仅有《Unsupervised Question Answering for Fact-Checking》提供数据集规模、两篇均未提供相对基线的具体提升数值，因此二者有关性能提升的回答不具可比性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-09342b6b2a0eabec97459832"}, {"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}, {"paper_id": "1603.09381", "chunk_id": "c-f45dc29ea469cc573133e3c9"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
